  "evidence": [
    "Standing user direction authorizes evidence-backed structural recovery and coordinator-reviewed compiling closure, retaining original quirks and historical claims through reviewed matching regressions. Two independent pinned reviews establish639324..63932E installs six callback DWORDs into9C0B80. Projection6404F0/640A27 starts at9C0B90 with nonnegative0,4,...100 indexes. The first16bytes contain disjoint allocate/release/read/write callbacks; seek/tell intentionally overlap projection words. External/unmapped writers remain unverified, not assumed absent.",
    "Authorize replacing only CaviarOutputMessageWindowCandidate::callback_prefix_ opaque byte array by four actual typed function-pointer members, using the same signatures/order as VoxIoCallbacks. Prefer four fields directly in the existing owner to avoid a needless new prefix type and fixture dependency. Replace only four corresponding vox_*_slot memcpy loads by direct live member loads. Retain seek/tell byte-representation getters, full24byte installer memcpy, projection_words_, message_, all original overlaps, names/bindings/spans/claims, total size2E0, projection+10 and message+1E0 onWin32 and equivalent existing host-width relationships. Add explicit size/offset witnesses; do not infer an original parent-class allocation extent.",
    "The template allocator void* to T* conversion may become ordinary static_cast<T*> rather than reinterpret_cast<T*> with no other allocation/error/publication-order changes. Remove only newly unused callback typedefs. Do not change constness of message slots, storage binding syntax, any other raw renderer view, function bodies/call order, packing policy, global linkage, flags, aliases, projection behavior or initializer content.",
    "Update actual-source extraction fixtures and old byte-array-only assertions in the listed tests, preserving and strengthening their behavioral controls. Add meaningful wrong callback/member/offset or caching mutations, exercise callback replacement/reentrancy, all six callback representations, full table install, projection overwriting seek while first four callbacks remain callable, message/projection offsets and byte preservation. No compiler steering or fabricated standalone storage. Host controls do not establish target ABI or original all-writer closure.",
    "All Caviar mapped bodies are subjects for conservative collateral measurement, not permission to alter unrelated bodies. Other header consumers remain preserved outside scope; coordinator qualifies fresh native Win32 layout and complete191-object application/build/link, every local mapping and outside-body residuals. Worker uses apply_patch and uv host tests only; no native compiler, preparation, Git or recording. Return findings needing other files for coordinator scope expansion. No claim demotion, false exactness or automatic/full-game acceptance."
  ],
